- Day 40 Fifth-day: first sitting (M2). Day 41 Sixth-day. Day 42 Seventh-day (M2's month-close log). Day 43 First-day. Day 44 Second-day. Day 45 Third-day. Day 46 Fourth-day. Day 47 Fifth-day = second sitting. Day 48 Sixth-day. Day 49 Seventh-day = last day of the inventory's sixth week (weeks counted from service, day 8: week 6 = days 43–49). Day 54 Fifth-day = third sitting, the preliminary.
