   200	
   201	"Very good, sir."
   202	
   203	In the outer office the clerk wrote the candle into the consumables in his tidy upright figures, against the Archmarshal's name. It would sit there as long as the ledger did: one stub of tallow, the only odd line in that room's accounts in nineteen years.
   204	
