   219	
   220	He wrote the session down that night in two sentences. *They read the whole truth about me into the record this morning and nobody stood up to argue with any of it. It was the dullest hour of the year.*
   221	
   222	In the afternoon, on the hill, there was a small dispute at Bracken's counter.
